{title: The Princess Who Saved the Royal Line}
{subtitle: 2 Kings 11:1; 2 Chronicles 22:10; 2 Kings 11:2–3; 2 Chronicles 22:11–12; 2 Kings 11:3; 2 Chronicles 22:12}
{key: Cm}
{tempo: 81}
